        hole_core: (0.30, Taste("marks effects: ASSUMED the core's radius in the decal square. The square spans two units, the quad's side, so the core is this many sides across: footprint's quad of 1 / hole_core calibres puts one calibre across the core, the lip and the rings outside it (DERIVED: 3.3 calibres, 0.29 m at 88 mm)")),
